method.description:
Creates a new [YAMLStyle] from a [Dictionary] representation. The dictionary should contain properties and child styles in the format produced by [method to_dictionary]. Returns a new [YAMLStyle] instance with all the settings defined in the dictionary.
[b]Example:[/b]
[codeblock lang=gdscript]
# Create a style dictionary programmatically
var style_dict = {
    "string": YAMLStyle.STRING_QUOTE_DOUBLE,
    "integer": YAMLStyle.INT_DECIMAL,
    "flow": YAMLStyle.FLOW_NONE,
    "children": {
        "inventory": {
            "flow": YAMLStyle.FLOW_SINGLE
        }
    }
}

# Convert dictionary to a YAMLStyle
var style = YAMLStyle.from_dictionary(style_dict)

# Use the style for serialization
var result = YAML.stringify(game_data, style)
[/codeblock]

Incorporates settings from another style into this style. Any property explicitly set in [param other] overrides the corresponding property in this style. Child styles are merged recursively. Returns this style instance for method chaining. [codeblock lang=gdscript] var base_style = YAML.create_style() base_style.set_string_style(YAMLStyle.STRING_QUOTE_DOUBLE)
var override_style = YAML.create_style() override_style.set_flow_style(YAMLStyle.FLOW_SINGLE)
# Merge keeps both string style and adds flow style base_style.merge_with(override_style) [/codeblock]
